# Tester of the Tangential keeps its counter when the counter can't be moved (CR 122.5: if the second object can't have the
# counter put on it, none is removed from the first). Quick Study (three mana) gives the Tester its +1/+1 counter on turn 1
# (increment, a 2/2). Bot2 plays Ornithopter and Solemnity ("Counters can't be put on artifacts or creatures") on turn 2.
# At the beginning of combat on turn 3 Bot1 pays X = 1: the Ornithopter can't get the counter, so the Tester keeps it.
# (The same move without Solemnity is tester-of-the-tangential-moves-only-x-counters-and-keeps-the-rest.)

[Bot1 Deck]
Tester of the Tangential
Mox Sapphire
Mox Jet
Mox Pearl
Mox Emerald
Black Lotus
Quick Study
Island x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Ornithopter
Mox Sapphire
Mox Jet
Mox Pearl
Solemnity
Island x20

